{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Approach, but quietly. Don't let them hear you...</h2><strong>Are you ready to step into this dark world? </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/695007db2e60826c26038f6bb018c6f7.poster.avif?t=1772976770\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/695007db2e60826c26038f6bb018c6f7.webm?t=1772976770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/695007db2e60826c26038f6bb018c6f7.mp4?t=1772976770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You will determine the purpose of this journey with your choices. Did you wake up to discover the truth, or will you continue to live the lies? <br>Join Aaron on his surreal journey to find the answer. <i>Sometimes under the sky, sometimes in the shadows of the walls.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/86c99df4504e4a286552c3f1f4a664de.poster.avif?t=1772976770\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/86c99df4504e4a286552c3f1f4a664de.webm?t=1772976770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/86c99df4504e4a286552c3f1f4a664de.mp4?t=1772976770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><strong>Immersive Story:</strong> <br>A mystery-filled story about Aaron's struggle to regain his memories and reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/784b3c5bf799845fb16d450d2e271d18.poster.avif?t=1772976770\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/784b3c5bf799845fb16d450d2e271d18.webm?t=1772976770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/784b3c5bf799845fb16d450d2e271d18.mp4?t=1772976770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Tough Choices:</strong><br>The choices you make throughout the game will determine Aaron's fate and the end of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/2edde740d57982b905b8f723330dbd3a.poster.avif?t=1772976770\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/2edde740d57982b905b8f723330dbd3a.webm?t=1772976770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/2edde740d57982b905b8f723330dbd3a.mp4?t=1772976770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Psychological tension:</strong><br>Spooky hallucinations and dark atmosphere will give you a surreal gaming experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/30ddaec025c8a952d54a231d6fb45a61.poster.avif?t=1772976770\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/30ddaec025c8a952d54a231d6fb45a61.webm?t=1772976770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867800/extras/30ddaec025c8a952d54a231d6fb45a61.mp4?t=1772976770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></spa